<view class="subpage"><mode-banner /><view class="eyebrow">ONE THING AT A TIME</view><view class="title page-heading">给自己，一个小目标。</view><view class="caption">先专注做好一件事，再慢慢变厉害。</view>
<view class="field-label">01 · 选择打卡分类</view><view class="categories"><view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseCategory" class="category-item {{selectedCategory === item.id ? 'chosen' : ''}}"><view class="category-icon" style="color:{{item.color}}">{{item.icon}}</view><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="radio">{{selectedCategory === item.id ? '✓' : ''}}</view></view></view>
<view class="field-label">02 · 写下你要做到的事</view><textarea class="input goal-input" maxlength="40" value="{{title}}" placeholder="{{info.placeholder}}" bindinput="typeTitle" auto-height="{{false}}" /><view class="row field-hint"><text bindtap="useSuggestion" class="suggestion">试试：{{info.suggestion}} ↗</text><text>{{title.length}}/40</text></view>
<view class="field-label">03 · 先坚持多久？</view><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{durations}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{days === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-days="{{item}}" bindtap="chooseDays">{{item}} 天</view></view>
<view class="promise card"><view class="promise-icon">✦</view><view><view class="promise-title">我的行动约定</view><view class="caption">从今天开始，每天给这个目标一次行动。<br/>没做到也没关系，真实记录，重新出发。</view></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{formError}}" class="error">{{formError}}</view><button class="primary bottom-action save-goal" bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">就这么定了，开始挑战 ↗</button><view class="field-hint center">每人同时专注一个目标，历史记录一直保留。</view></view>
